<title>YEMEN: Yemen central bank foreign assets rose in May.</title>
<headline>Yemen central bank foreign assets rose in May.</headline>
<dateline>SANAA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen central bank foreign assets rose to $1.203 billion at the end of May from $1.190 billion at the end of April, a bank official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>At the end of 1996 the bank's foreign assets stood at $1.36 billion, up from $622 million at end-1995.</p>
</text>
